WEBVTT

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.280
All right, one more time!

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:41.030
Come on, you two!

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:43.790
Hey.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:58.470
Now!

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.810
Almost there, I'd say.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:17.280
Hold it, Nishi.

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:20.280
You don't have to splash him awake anymore.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:28.270
He's finally earned his rest. Let's let him sleep till morning.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:44.560
But you think Joe's gonna get mad when he wakes up, old man?

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:49.560
He might say something like, "Hey, Nishi, why didn't you splash me awake?"

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:53.560
You're right. If we let him have his way, he'd keep going till he killed himself.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:56.530
But he's done enough for today.

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:59.570
He just has to give it his all tomorrow.

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:02.570
Good night, Joe.

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:29.930
Water...

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.320
Water...

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:21.110
Come on, just let us in for a second!

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.420
No, please! You can't!

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:25.530
Why can't we?

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.040
There shouldn't be a problem, should there?

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.850
Or is he doing some kind of secret training like Wolf did?

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:32.080
No, no, that's not it...

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.430
Then just let us have a peek!

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:36.880
We won't disturb his training!

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.800
Y-You're putting me in a tough spot...

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:48.930
He is not undergoing any secret training of the kind you are imagining.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.940
You may enter, if you so choose.

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:53.450
But, Miss...

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:54.310
Don't worry.

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:58.470
He is not a man who would let others distract him.

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:01.460
But promise me this.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.820
Do not make any loud sounds or use flash photography.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:10.830
His body is weak, so he is sensitive to the slightest stimulations, particularly bright lights.

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:12.370
Can you promise me that?

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:13.220
U-Uh...

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:13.830
Yes...

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:15.480
Then go ahead.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:38.980
H-Hey.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.230
Wh-Who's that over there?

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:53.380
U-Uh, who's that in the corner of the room?

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:55.500
That's Shiraki Gym's commissioned doctor.

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:56.500
Doctor?

00:05:56.940 --> 00:06:00.460
Yes. He's there to supervise his training.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:04.130
After all, he's struggling against his physical limits right now.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:08.790
In fact, if he were a normal person, he'd have long since passed his limits.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:58.330
He can't go on any longer, Miss.

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:01.750
Yes. I understand.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.920
Rikiishi-kun?

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:15.760
Good work. Your training's over for today.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.480
Now then, go back to your room and rest.

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:27.480
But I thought the schedule said I'd have another two rounds...

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:30.480
No. You're done.

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:36.520
Looks like I guessed wrong again.

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:37.990
Sorry, Miss.

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:42.910
It's fine. Now, let's go.

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:10.510
I can't believe the calm and collected Rikiishi would miscount the number of sparring rounds.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.700
Well, look how much weight he lost. Something must've gone wrong up there-

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:18.200
Absolutely not! Rikiishi-kun is the very image of collectedness!

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:22.130
He was right. He really had two rounds to go.

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:24.200
We were the ones who lied to him.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:27.190
But his body would've given in if we hadn't!

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:36.630
You're on duty today?

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:37.470
Yes.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:41.390
Best of luck.{tlc- is this accurate}

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:42.770
Yes, understood.

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:52.270
Do you need something?

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:56.320
Y-Yes, u-uh... Is Rikiishi-kun in there?

00:09:56.930 --> 00:09:57.700
Yes.

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:05.440
Uh, do you mind if we get an interview with him?

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.900
Go ahead. The windows are open.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:13.730
But keep it to just a couple of minutes. Rikiishi-kun is very tired.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.280
Yes, thank you.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:20.890
Come on, let's go.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:21.860
R-Right!

00:10:56.680 --> 00:11:00.920
Shiraki Gym prides itself on being a modern facility,  but it looked more like an insane asylum to me!

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.150
They're crazy, I tell you!

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:06.220
Not just Rikiishi, but that Yohko woman, too!

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:09.580
Is there anything you need, Miss?

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:14.340
Rikiishi-kun, why don't you go outside once in a while?

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:55.170
Come over here, Rikiishi-kun!

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:57.630
It's nice and cool!

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:30.760
Isn't it a pretty flower, Rikiishi-kun?

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:34.780
It's bloomed all alone on the shore in the middle of such a cold winter.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:42.500
I know.{retimed-Reed}

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:47.780
You couldn't care less about the beauty of the sea and flowers right now.

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:49.740
You're a great man, Rikiishi-kun.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:54.580
No matter how much you suffer, you never forget that you are Rikiishi Toru.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:59.580
A relentless, callous man who lives only to defeat his opponent - a fighting machine.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.720
That's you, Rikiishi Toru. Am I right?

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:08.590
If you appreciated the beauty of a flower, you would instantly lose confidence in who you are!

00:15:09.310 --> 00:15:13.330
And Rikiishi Toru is going to live the rest of his life showing off false courage,

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.600
without accepting anyone's help, isn't he?{split by timer}

00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:59.660
What's the matter, Rikiishi-san?

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:06.460
Open up! Water! Open up!

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:09.460
Water! Water! Open up!

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:18.930
Open up! Open up! Open up!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:20.420
Water! Open up!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:21.930
Water!

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.840
Open up! Open up!

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:26.430
Open up!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:33.870
Water! Water! Water!

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:39.700
Water...

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.740
No more! No more weight loss!

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:50.130
No more weight loss!

00:17:53.360 --> 00:17:54.790
No more weight loss...

00:17:56.690 --> 00:17:57.510
Water...

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:27.430
Water!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:30.080
Water! Give me water!

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:37.720
Water!

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.050
Water! Water!

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:44.260
Water!

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:10.620
Water... Water...

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:15.020
Cold water... Somebody... Cold water...

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:42.610
The doctor said that cold water is bad for your body.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:52.120
But I have some hot water here. Though it may not taste as good as the cold water you want...

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:06.460
I'm sorry for wrapping wires around the faucets.

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:10.190
But I thought that this was bound to happen eventually.

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:13.850
But you held on all this time.

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:20.940
Here. This is for you.

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:30.940
Don't worry. I'm not sad that you gave up on the weight loss because you couldn't stand the thirst.

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:37.460
I'm just... I'm just so happy you're showing me that you have a human weakness...

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.910
Even... Even if it's just a small one.

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:49.710
Here. Drink this, Rikiishi-kun.

00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:51.430
You don't have to worry about a thing.

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:56.810
It's not like you'll suddenly gain weight from drinking a single glass of hot water.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:21:01.970
And if, against the odds, this cup causes you to fail the weight loss,

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:08.830
I'll talk to my grandfather and do anything I can to cancel the match.

00:21:11.350 --> 00:21:14.340
It's just a cup of hot water.

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:19.340
Even if you drink this, no one would accuse you

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:21.210
of ceasing to be Rikiishi Toru!

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:37.730
Miss...

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:43.820
Your consideration is enough for me.

00:21:55.280 --> 00:21:56.570
Rikiishi-kun...

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:02.080
I was just about to give in.

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:05.060
Even when the match is just before my eyes...

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:06.880
But I'm all right now.

00:22:12.480 --> 00:22:16.220
This may be a pretentious way to put it, but I, Rikiishi Toru,

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:22.110
have strengthened my resolve just by seeing your tears!

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:28.130
I won't need keys or guards anymore.

00:22:30.400 --> 00:22:35.010
I will trade blows with Joe even with this thinned-out body of mine.

00:22:38.150 --> 00:22:40.250
Wait! Rikiishi-kun, wait!

00:22:42.910 --> 00:22:44.180
Rikiishi-kun...

00:22:53.190 --> 00:22:56.000
Thank you, Miss...

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:01.910
So much...

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:45.220
Joe's and Rikiishi's long training regimes have ended,

00:23:45.220 --> 00:23:47.810
and the long-awaited day of the fight has finally come.

00:23:47.810 --> 00:23:55.070
And in Korakuen Hall, Rikiishi's greatest and final challenge, the weigh-in, begins!

00:23:55.070 --> 00:24:01.030
Now, as Joe and Rikiishi shake hands and confirm each other's fighting spirit,

00:24:01.030 --> 00:24:03.080
which way is tomorrow!?

00:24:17.060 --> 00:24:20.100
Yuke kouya wo

00:24:17.060 --> 00:24:20.100
Go to the wilderness!

00:24:21.180 --> 00:24:23.940
Oira boxer

00:24:21.180 --> 00:24:23.940
I am a boxer.

00:24:24.730 --> 00:24:31.700
Yuuhi ga giragira otoko no yume wa

00:24:24.730 --> 00:24:31.700
The evening sun glitters upon the dreams of men!

00:24:33.410 --> 00:24:37.370
Minna wa kono ore wo nasakemuyo to iu

00:24:33.410 --> 00:24:37.370
Everyone says that I am merciless.

00:24:37.370 --> 00:24:39.410
Tsuki ni hoete hitori

00:24:37.370 --> 00:24:39.410
Howling at the moon alone.

00:24:41.500 --> 00:24:45.630
Oyanashi yadonashi no na mo nai boxer wa

00:24:41.500 --> 00:24:45.630
A parentless, homeless, nameless boxer

00:24:45.630 --> 00:24:48.630
Kusari wo kamikitta Yeah Yeah!

00:24:45.630 --> 00:24:48.630
has bitten off his chains! Yeah, yeah!

00:24:50.340 --> 00:24:53.260
Yuke kouya wo

00:24:50.340 --> 00:24:53.260
Go to the wilderness!

00:24:54.470 --> 00:24:56.970
Oira boxer

00:24:54.470 --> 00:24:56.970
I am a boxer.

00:24:58.100 --> 00:25:05.230
Asahi ga noboru yo otoko no mune ni {removed the Woo, but otherwise japanese is unchanged - Reed}
